lines:
Grah, keelhaul it all!{be01}
That hostage Pokémon turned out to
be worthless!{be01}
And to think I made a getaway...
In this tunnel to nowhere!{be01}
Hey! You!
So you want to battle me?

This is plain not right...{be01}
The Boss told me this would be a
slick-and-easy job to pull.{be01}
All I had to do was steal some package
from Devon.{be01}
Tch!
You want it back that badly, take it!

Peeko owes her life to you!{be01}
They call me Mr. Briney.
And, you are?{be01}
... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...
... ... ... ... ... ... ... ...{be01}
Ah, so you are {0100:0}!
I sincerely thank you!{be01}
Now, if there’s anything that troubles
you, don’t hesitate to tell me!{be01}
You can usually find me in my cottage
by the sea near Petalburg Woods.{be01}
Come, Peeko, we should make our way
home.{be01}
Peeko: Pihyoh!

... ...{be01}
Why can’t they keep digging?
Is the bedrock too hard?{be01}
My beloved awaits me in Verdanturf
Town just beyond here...{be01}
If Rustboro and Verdanturf were
joined by this tunnel, I could visit{be00}
her every day...{be01}
But this...
What am I to do?

On the other side of this rock...
My boyfriend is there.{be01}
He... He’s not just digging the tunnel
to come see me.{be01}
He works his hands raw and rough
for the benefit of everyone.

Wanda!
Now I can see you anytime!{be01}
Wanda: That’s...wonderful.{be01}
Please, take some rest at my home.
